        "identifier": "https://github.com/sergioconti/so3-r1c-and-not-qc",
        "note": "Conti, Dolzmann and Dondl's Lean 4 formalization of a frame-indifferent rank-one convex, non-quasiconvex function on 3x3 matrices, with its own definitions. It includes adaptations to R^3 of parts of Šverák's argument (of the test map w, as phi(x) = (sin x1, sin x2, -sin(x1 + x2)), of its gradients in L and of the integral (4)) and the \"only if\" half of Lemma 1; not Lemma 2, the Theorem or the Corollary. The proofs here were written without consulting it; searches and checks of 21-22 November 2026 displayed parts of it (docs/Cassese/CREDITS.md), and nothing from it was used.",
        "relationship": "independent"
      },
      {
