        "note": "Cassese's Lean formalization of results of arXiv:2608.03488 (2x m and 2x3 examples); not a formalization of this paper. The proofs here were written without consulting it; searches and checks of 21-22 November 2026 displayed parts of it (docs/Cassese/CREDITS.md), and nothing from it was used.",
